{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Neon Dash</i></strong> is a Retro-Futurism style rhythm platform game. Get past challenging obstacles to the music's beat, and journey back to the dreamy 80s to push your limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, fly, switch gravity, and teleport to the beat of the music to avoid various obstacles across the platforms. By collecting <i><strong>BEAT</strong></i>\u00a0and <i><strong>STAR\u00a0</strong></i>items, you can unlock avatars with different styles and attempt to gather them all to achieve the perfect completion challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768570/extras/9fd70d337ea4f7162d1e472442943ef5.avif?t=1759565662\" width=960 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm-based platform game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging level design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro 80s-style music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunset, neon lights, palm trees, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive items like flying, teleportation, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items to achieve perfect completion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock avatars with different styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle-Friendly Animated Wallpaper</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768570?t=1759565662","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768570/c44186540172e6172212b0cceb0e7b6625b3b0e1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759565662","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768570/95f523b0a73c168cadcdd8091fa29eb0bc6d13b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759565662","cap